Build 041 (041M, diagnostic only; review "Claude_Handoff_Build_040_FIXED.md"): no budget changes.
- Fiber stacks are filled with a pattern; a switch into a fiber whose lowest 256 bytes changed logs
  EDEN_FIBER_STACK_OVERFLOW and aborts; EDEN_FIBER_STACKS every 30 s: alive, size, deepest use.
- (src/direct_memory.c) every direct allocation/release of the app in a ring that never allocates
  (EDEN_DMEM lines each second; the crash report lists the last 160); EDEN_DMEM_HELD compares the
  app's running total with what the pool has given out.
- (headless/heap_arenas.inc) EDEN_HEAP_LARGE: every live large heap block with its call chain;
  census sites start with the allocator wrapper's caller (aligned_alloc's re-charged).

